{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1417751-how-would-you-convert-overlord-to-2e-exalted","id":1417751,"title":"How would you convert Overlord to 2E Exalted?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-11T19:27:19-07:00","id":1417751,"title":"How would you convert Overlord to 2E Exalted?","content":"I am a fan of the light novels Overlord, that were converted into the popular anime of the same name. How would you convert it\u2019s characters into 2E Exalted Terms? Is Momonga a death themed infernal, and the Floor Guardians are his 3rd Circle souls? Or perhaps he is an Abyssal, and there is something else going on. How would the characters break down in your estimation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T15:47:45-07:00","id":1419254,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1417751-how-would-you-convert-overlord-to-2e-exalted#post1417751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am a fan of the light novels Overlord, that were converted into the popular anime of the same name. How would you convert it\u2019s characters into 2E Exalted Terms? Is Momonga a death themed infernal, and the Floor Guardians are his 3rd Circle souls? Or perhaps he is an Abyssal, and there is something else going on. How would the characters break down in your estimation?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Actually, that's a pretty good question. But personally i'd say neither. Conceptually, as a human soul within a superpowered inhuman body that is not really his and with alien patterns of logic occasionally tweaking his (lack of) emotions, i'd say his nature is pretty similar to an alchemical (well, except made of bones or something simulating it.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, the whole &quot;mind in a made-up body&quot; thing could go well with a fae assumption too. Not saying he's fae per se. But the virtual reality MMO he was into before could definitely fit into some sort of wyld-shaping/dream-manipulation framework that might transform a sleeping/dying human being (or the accidental backup of it) into some manner of Raksha-like being.<br /> <br /> The Floor Guardians would <i>definitely </i>go well as a variety of commoner fae, behemoths or other beings/things that are incrementally evolving from archetypes/roles into individuals of their own, imho.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 11-11-2020, 09:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}